allow qml QtQuick.Effects         desktop/**   LGPL-3.0-only
allow qml QtQml                   desktop/**   LGPL-3.0-only
allow qml QtQml.Models            desktop/**   LGPL-3.0-only
allow qml QtCore                  desktop/**   LGPL-3.0-only

allow cmake Qt6                   desktop/**   LGPL-3.0-only
