# --- Colour ------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Every colour comes from a token. A colour written into a component is how
# white text ends up on a white surface in one variant. Only the two generated
# token files hold colour values.

literals desktop/kit/tokens/Theme.qml,desktop/kit/pax/PaxTheme.qml

